2. Statement of changes

  Material from the upstream datasets has been modified. Relative to the
  originals, the pipeline:

    - converts records into a shared canonical format;
    - generates alternative model responses for each demonstration;
    - scores reference and alternative responses;
    - filters pairs by score;
    - exports canonical, DPO, and SFT variants (Parquet, optional JSONL/CSV);
    - records run metadata in manifest.json.

  Files are therefore changed files within the meaning of section 4(b) of the
  Apache License 2.0.


3. Model-generated content

  Alternative responses were generated with third-party language models,
  including Kimi-K2, Qwen, and OSS models. Use of those outputs is subject to
  the respective model licenses and acceptable-use policies. The upstream
  Toucan-1.5M release already redistributes outputs from these models under
  Apache License 2.0.


